<section class="section actone" id="problem" aria-labelledby="actone-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="actone__grid">
      <div class="actone__lead reveal">
        <h2 class="actone__title" id="actone-title">
          Your building wastes about a third of the energy it buys. So why
          didn't your last upgrade pay off?
        </h2>
        <p class="actone__stat ph" data-countup="30" tabindex="0">~30%</p>
        <p class="actone__stat-note">
          That's the EPA's figure for the average commercial building. Most
          hotels have never had anyone qualified find out where theirs goes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="actone__body reveal">
        <p class="actone__hook">
          Here's the irony: the upgrades you bought to cut your energy use may
          be quietly fighting each other.
        </p>
        <p>
          You added lighting. Maybe controls, maybe solar. Each vendor optimized
          the one thing they sell, then left. But a hotel isn't a stack of
          separate upgrades; it's one electrical system. Bolt pieces on without
          anyone designing how they fit together and they interfere: power
          quality degrades, equipment runs harder and fails sooner, and the
          savings on the brochure quietly leak away.
        </p>
        <p class="actone__turn">
          That isn't bad luck. Every vendor gets paid to install their box, so
          each one optimizes their own piece and none of them owns the result.
          Your building wasn't left incoherent by accident. It was left
          incoherent by incentive.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .actone {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .actone__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 360px), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .actone__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .actone__hook {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .actone__stat {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--gold-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .actone__stat-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--body);
    max-width: 44ch;
  }
  .actone__body {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .actone__body p {
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .actone__turn {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    color: var(--ink) !important;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .actone__body.reveal {
      transition-delay: 0.1s;
    }
  }
</style>
